{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112657","id":3001294960,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6y5CBw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112657","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112657.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112657.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112657","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112657/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112657/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112657/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bdfe8549b878f11d0622479030aaccc82d40d1d9","number":112657,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Switch `RID_Alloc::owns` to lock-free (reverted)","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nWhilst working on #112481 and running various benchmarks, including an MRP that @clayjohn created to test #104194, I observed 7% of the total CPU time was spent in `RenderingDevice::texture_is_valid`, which in turn calls `RID_Alloc::owns`. It is `owns` that spent most of its time acquiring and releasing a mutex. The `RID_Alloc::get_or_null` API uses atomics for a lock-free approach, which can also be applied to `owns`, given `get_or_null` also performs the validation. After the change, `texture_is_valid` drops from 7.3% to 1.3%:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2524\" height=\"1832\" alt=\"Clipboard - November 12, 2025 1_01 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0336ae0f-8df2-4a9c-86ac-12e38e2f329d\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","f